;;-*-Lisp-*-
(in-package goal)

;; name: texture-anim-tables.gc
;; name in dgo: texture-anim-tables
;; dgos: ENGINE, GAME

;; og:preserve-this landing notes: all twelve texture-anim arrays land as their
;; static data (the jakx sky array is 4 entries: clouds clut, fog x2 per
;; viewport, ocean-sky - no jak3 noise octaves). set-car-highlight! lands live
;; as of the 2026-08-18 rung (the jak3-transplant placement repair already
;; resolved it, a fresh scoped decode confirms zero errors); the car array is
;; never init!'d on the bring-up so this stays unreachable, same as texture-anim
;; rung notes for the layer-compositing path. car-texture-anim-layer-func still
;; carries real decode errors (raw VIF/GIF DMA packing, no jak3 twin to
;; transplant against, same class as texture-anim.gc's held functions) and
;; stays commented.

;; DECOMP BEGINS

